From: MusMat17 <stas.krylov@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: allow OpenWrt packages to enable UDP tunnel support

NET_UDP_TUNNEL has no prompt, so Kconfig drops the modular value requested
by kmod-udptunnel4/6 unless an in-tree driver selects it. AmneziaWG is built
outside the kernel tree and cannot provide that select. Expose the helper
to OpenWrt's kernel configuration, preserving its existing dependency
chain through NET_IP_TUNNEL to DST_CACHE and GRO_CELLS.

--- a/net/ipv4/Kconfig
+++ b/net/ipv4/Kconfig
@@ -317,2 +317,2 @@
 config NET_UDP_TUNNEL
-	tristate
+	tristate "UDP tunnel support"
